Package: dawaR
Title: An API Wrapper for 'DAWA' - 'The Danish Address Web API'
Date: 2026-09-15
Version: 0.3.4
Authors@R: c( person("Aleksander", "Bang-Larsen", ,
        "contact@aleksanderbl.dk", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-7984-4650")), person(given =
        "Agency of Climate Data", role = c("ctb"), comment = c("The
        Danish Agency of Climate Data provides this API for the public
