        distribution in this package.")))
Description: Functions for interacting with all sections of the
        official 'Danish Address Web API' (also known as 'DAWA')
        <https://api.dataforsyningen.dk>. The development of this
        package is completely independent from the government agency,
        Klimadatastyrelsen, who maintains the API.
